  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 84,
    "summary": "The righteous cry unto the living God—It is better to be a doorkeeper in the house of the Lord than to dwell in the tents of wickedness—No good thing is withheld from those who walk uprightly.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "How amiable are thy tabernacles, O Lord of hosts!",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 31,
            "text": "HEB lovely is Thy dwelling place."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 15
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "My soul longeth, yea, even fainteth for the courts of the Lord: my heart and my flesh crieth out for the living God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "Ps. 119:81."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, the sparrow hath found an house, and the swallow a nest for herself, where she may lay her young, even thine altars, O Lord of hosts, my King, and my God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 103,
            "end": 107
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Blessed are they that dwell in thy house: they will be still praising thee. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 11
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Blessed is the man whose strength is in thee; in whose heart are the ways of them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "TG Strength."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 10
          },
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 36
          },
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 64
          },
          {
            "start": 74,
            "end": 82
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Who passing through the valley of Baca make it a well; the rain also filleth the pools.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "They go from strength to strength, every one of them in Zion appeareth before God.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "Deut. 16:16."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "O Lord God of hosts, hear my prayer: give ear, O God of Jacob. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Behold, O God our shield, and look upon the face of thine anointed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For a day in thy courts is better than a thousand. I had rather be a doorkeeper in the house of my God, than to dwell in the tents of wickedness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 49,
            "text": "IE a thousand elsewhere."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 26
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For the Lord God is a sun and shield: the Lord will give grace and glory: no good thing will he withhold from them that walk uprightly.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "3 Ne. 25:2."
          },
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 36,
            "text": "Prov. 30:5."
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "TG Grace."
          },
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 104,
            "text": "Rev. 21:7; D&C 76:59 (50–64)."
          },
          {
            "start": 120,
            "end": 124,
            "text": "TG Walking with God."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 19
          },
          {
            "start": 82,
            "end": 87
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "O Lord of hosts, blessed is the man that trusteth in thee.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 25,
            "end": 27
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
